@title Member portal login flow
@subtitle Identity team, Pinecrest Credit Union
@date 2026-10-08

Draft dated 2026-10-08.

## Login flow

diagram login sequence title="Member portal login"

login: user "User" user
login: browser "Browser" client
login: app "Web App" svc
login: auth "Auth Server" auth
login: api "Profile API" api
login: user -> browser : click Sign in
login: browser -> app : GET /login
login: app --> browser : 302 to /authorize with PKCE challenge
login: browser -> auth : GET /authorize
login: auth --> user : show login and MFA prompt
login: user -> auth : credentials + MFA code
login: auth --> browser : 302 to /callback with code
login: browser -> app : GET /callback with code
login: app -> auth : POST /token with code verifier
login: auth --> app : access token + ID token + refresh token
login: app -> api : GET /me with bearer token
login: api --> app : profile JSON
login: app --> browser : set session cookie and render dashboard

## Tokens

table = Token,Lifetime,Stored where; Access token,15 minutes,server-side session; ID token,15 minutes,server-side session; Refresh token,30 days,encrypted session store; Session cookie,12 hours,"browser (HttpOnly, Secure)"

## Security notes

- PKCE is mandatory.
- MFA is required for every member.
- Failed logins lock the account after 5 attempts.

!! Tokens must never be exposed to browser JavaScript or kept in browser storage.
